{"4620720": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Tank POV", "steam_appid": 4620720, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is created to let you experience stories from my 3D YouTube animations in an interactive way.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Currently available Game Modes: 2</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Horror Game Mode (Currently avaiable maps: 1)</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chapter 1</strong><br><strong>Mega Grill</strong> <br><br>You have been kidnapped by the Grill Master’s minions, but you played dead so well that they left you alone for a moment. This is your chance. Run for your life.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Find usefull items.</i></strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Solve puzzles</i></strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Uncover hidden truth</i></strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Experience 2 endings</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >RUN and don’t become the Grill Master’s product.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4620720/extras/8b8cff3695695310ae4991146ed348f9.avif?t=1784483732\" width=1044 height=886 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Jumping Game Mode (Currently avaiable maps: 3)</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong></strong><br><strong><br>Max's Dream</strong><br>Max fell asleep and he is dreaming about tasty submarines.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eat Submarines</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fall</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Respawn</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump some more</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img clas